.postgres-data/

# Backups: the repository ships ONE sanitized, synthetic-data dump
# (backups/sample-*.dump). Everything else produced locally stays out.
backups/*
!backups/README.md
!backups/sample-*.dump
!backups/sample-*.dump.sha256
